 navigation. Didn't look at the code.\r\n\r\nNow that there is a project setting for this, I wonder whether we should name this in such a way that it's limitations are also clear and that a potential variation to this algorithm could then be named logically alongside the current balloon algorithm. In particular, I'm thinking about a variation of the balloon algorithm that is less '4-directional' and more 'any direction' – and thus potentially more intuitive with joystick controls or UI's that desire diagonal navigation (like some of the skill trees in the web project). @rsubtil what do you think: should such an improvement be a different algorithm, or an improvement to the one you already made?","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120631#pullrequestreview-4712649659","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120631","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-07-16T10:12:20Z"},{"id":4940543190,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJnq01g","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"387a51bdaabe40956aa249fc5292cb61a4e8e94a","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi"},"body":"The code looks mostly fine.\nDidn't test.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120631#pullrequestreview-4940543190","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120631","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-08-14T19:51:59Z"},{"id":4943610549,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJqmCtQ","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"387a51bdaabe40956aa249fc5292cb61a4e8e94